        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE REAL PROPERTY GAINS TAX ACT 1976 Commencement of amendments to the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Part comes into operation on 1 January 2025. Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended in section 13—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) Where a person makes a return under this Act, the return shall be furnished to the Director General in the prescribed form in an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 57a.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (6) the following subsection: “(6a) The notification referred to in subsection (6) shall be furnished to the Director General in an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 57a.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (7) the following subsection: “(7) For the purposes of section 21b, a person who disposes of a chargeable asset shall serve the notification referred to in subsection (6) on the acquirer within sixty days from the date of the disposal and such notification shall be deemed to have been served on the acquirer on the day on which the notification is furnished to the Director General in accordance with subsection (6a).”. Amendment of section 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 14(5) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “furnished to” the words “served on”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “furnished such” the words “served such”. Amendment of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 15(4) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “furnished to” the words “served on”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “furnished such” the words “served such”. Substitution of section 21a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 21a the following section: “Certificate of non-chargeability 21a. (1) The Director General shall notify the disposer in a certificate of non-chargeability in the prescribed form in an electronic medium or by way of an electronic transmission in accordance with section 57a where he is satisfied that no chargeable gain has arisen. (2) The certificate of non-chargeability referred to in subsection (1) shall be deemed to have been notified to the disposer in accordance with subsection (1) on the day the return under section 13 is furnished to the Director General.”. Amendment of section 21b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 21 b(5) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “notice of non-chargeability” the word “notification”. Amendment of section 29"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 29 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2a) Where a person has been convicted of an offence under subsection (1), the court may make a further order requiring the person to comply with the relevant provision of this Act under which the offence has been committed within thirty days, or such other period as the court considers appropriate, from the date the order is made.”. Amendment of section 36"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 36 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) Where a person has been convicted of an offence under subsection (1), the court may make a further order requiring the person to comply with the relevant provision of this Act under which the offence has been committed within thirty days, or such other period as the court considers appropriate, from the date the order is made.”. Amendment of section 57a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 57a of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) Any person or class of persons— (a) shall, if so required under this Act; or (b) may, if so allowed by the Director General, furnish any form prescribed under this Act in an electronic medium or by way of an electronic transmission.”. Amendment of Schedule 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subparagraph 9(1) of Schedule 3 to the principal Act is amended in paragraph (c) of the proviso, by substituting for the words “in writing addressed to the Director General” the words “furnished to the Director General in the prescribed form in an electronic medium or by way of an electronic transmission in accordance with section 57a”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 4, 6, 7, 8 and 9 come into operation on 1 January 2025."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 5 has effect for the year of assessment 2025 and subsequent years of assessment. Amendment of section 66a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended by inserting after subsection 66a(3) the following subsections: “(4) The tax identification number referred to in subsection (1) which has been assigned under this section and made accessible by the Director General to any person shall not be construed as classified material defined in subsection 138(5). (5) Where for any year of assessment a tax identification number is made accessible by the Director General to any person, the Director General shall not be liable for any loss or damage suffered by any person due to any error or omission arising in the service of providing access to the tax identification number, provided that the error or omission was made in good faith and in the ordinary course of the discharge of the duties of the Director General or occurred or arose as a result of any defect or breakdown in the service or in the equipment used for the provision of the service. (6) A person who, for any reason, has access to a tax identification number of any other person shall not use or cause or allow to be used the tax identification number for any purpose other than for the purposes of this Act. (7) Any person who contravenes subsection (6), shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding four thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both.”. Amendment of section 77b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 77b(1a) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “a person who is a company, limited liability partnership, trust body and co-operative society” the words “the person referred to in subsection (1)”. Amendment of section 82c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 82c(8) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “three days from the date” the words “seventy-two hours from the time”. Amendment of section 113a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 113a of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) Where a person— (a) makes an incorrect return, information return or report by omitting the information required to be provided in accordance with any rules made under paragraph 154(1)(c) to implement or facilitate the operation of an arrangement having effect under sections 132, 132a and 132b, where such arrangement relates to the automatic exchange of information or the furnishing of a country-by-country report, on behalf of himself or another person; or (b) gives any incorrect information in relation to any information required to be provided in accordance with any rules made under paragraph 154(1)(c) to implement or facilitate the operation of an arrangement having effect under sections 132, 132a and 132b, where such arrangement relates to the automatic exchange of information or the furnishing of a country-by-country report, on behalf of himself or another person, then, if no prosecution under subsection (1) has been instituted in respect of the incorrect return, information return or report, or incorrect information, the Director General may by notice in writing require that person to pay a penalty of not less than twenty thousand ringgit and not more than one hundred thousand ringgit and, if that person pays that penalty, or where the penalty is abated or remitted under subsection 124(3), so much, if any, of the penalty as has not been abated or remitted, he shall not be liable to be charged on the same facts with an offence under subsection (1).”. Amendment of section 125"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 125(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “or 113(2)” the words “, 113(2), 113a(2) or 113b(4)”. Amendment of Schedule 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 12 of Schedule 5 to the principal Act is amended by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that the appellant shall give a written notice to the Special Commissioners and the Director General within a period of six months from the date the appellant receives a written notice from the Director General under subsection 102(1).”."
      }
    },
