        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 22, 25, 26, 27, 34, 36, 37, 38, 40 and 41 come into operation on 1 January 2025."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 21, 23, 24, 28, 29, 30, 31, 32, 33, 35, 39 and 42 come into operation on 1 January 2026. Amendment of section 3a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended in section 3a—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) For the purpose of ascertaining whether an instrument is chargeable with duty under this Act or whether such duty has been paid, the Collector may by notice in writing, require any person— (a) to deliver to the Collector for examination any instrument, book, account, record or other document within the time specified in the notice; or (b) to attend personally before the Collector and produce for examination any instrument, book, account, record or other document.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “all books and documents” the words “all instruments, books, accounts, records, documents, objects, articles, materials and things”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “any books or documents” the words “any instrument, book, account, record, document, object, article, material or thing”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words “, and may, without fee or reward, make extracts from or copies of any such books or documents”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsections: “(2a) The Collector may, when entering any land, building or place pursuant to subsection (2)— (a) search and inspect any such instrument, book, account, record, document, object, article, material or thing; and (b) make extracts from, or copies of, any such instrument, book, account, record, document, object, article, material or thing without fee or reward. (2b) Where the Collector exercises his powers under subsections (2) and (2a), the owners or occupiers of such lands, buildings and places shall provide the Collector with reasonable facilities and assistance for the performance of his duties under this Act.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by substituting for the words “books or documents” wherever appearing the words “instruments, books, accounts, records, documents, objects, articles, materials or things”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3a) Where in the opinion of the Collector it is necessary for the purpose of ascertaining the duty payable on an instrument to examine any instrument, book, account, record or other document kept otherwise than in the national language, the Collector may by notice in writing require any person to furnish within a time specified in the notice (not being less than thirty days from the date of service of the notice) a translation in the national language of the instrument, book, account, record or other document in question: Provided that in East Malaysia this subsection shall have effect as if the words “or English language” were inserted after the words “national language” wherever they occur.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (5) the following subsection: “(5) Any person who— (a) without reasonable excuse, fails to comply with the notice under subsection (1) or (3a); (b) obstructs or refuses to give access to the Collector into any land, building or place pursuant to subsection (2) or (2a); (c) obstructs or hinders the Collector, or any valuer duly authorized by the Collector, in the exercise of any of the Collector’s powers under this section; (d) refuses to produce any instrument, book, account, record or other document in his custody or under his control on being required to do so by the Collector for the purposes of this Act; (e) fails to provide reasonable facilities or assistance to the Collector in the exercise of his powers pursuant to subsection (2b); or (f) refuses or fails to comply with any direction given by the Collector or any valuer duly authorized by the Collector to answer any question lawfully asked of him by the Collector or such valuer for the purposes of this section, shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit.”. Amendment of section 12a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 12a of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “Item 32(a)” the words “or (aa)”. Amendment of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 15(1) of the principal Act is amended in the proviso by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(a) no such instrument shall be deemed to be duly stamped unless— (i) the instrument is stamped with the duty to which it would but for this section be liable; or (ii) a return is furnished together with the instrument to the Collector in accordance with section 35a, and the instrument is assessed under paragraph 36(1)(b) and the Collector has certified under section 37 either that the full duty with which the instrument is chargeable has been paid, or that the instrument is not chargeable with duty; and”. Amendment of section 15a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 15a(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that no such instrument shall be deemed to be duly stamped unless— (a) the instrument is stamped with the duty to which it would but for this section be liable; or (b) a return is furnished together with the instrument to the Collector in accordance with section 35a, and the instrument is assessed under paragraph 36(1)(b) and the Collector has certified under section 37 either that the full duty with which the instrument is chargeable has been paid, or that the instrument is not chargeable with duty.”. Amendment of section 17"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 17 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “Item 32(a)” wherever appearing the words “or (aa)”. Amendment of section 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 20(4) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “section 12 a and Item 32(a)” the words “section 12a, and Item 32(a) or (aa)”. Amendment of section 20b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 20b(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “Item 32(a)” the words “or (aa)”. New sections 35a and 35b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting before section 36 the following sections: “Return 35a. (1) Every person, other than an authorized person under section 9, shall furnish to the Collector a return in the prescribed form together with an instrument which is executed and chargeable with duty by an electronic medium in accordance with section 77a. (2) For the purposes of this section, a return for a year of assessment shall— (a) specify the description of instrument and the amount of duty with which the instrument is chargeable; and (b) contain such particulars as may be required by the Collector. Duty to keep record 35b. Where an instrument is chargeable with duty, the person who is liable to pay the duty chargeable on such instrument shall keep the instrument and all relevant documents in connection with such instrument for a period of seven years from the date the duty is paid for the purpose of ascertaining that the proper amount of stamp duty has been paid on the instrument.”. Amendment of section 36"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 36 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/49/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
